::node[project_kickoff]
->[:role=skill]
->[:keywords=new project, kickoff, setup, template, notion, slack channel, project setup]

::dense
Creates Notion wiki + Slack channel + team invites for a new project in one workflow.

::steps
1. Ask the user for the Project Name, a brief description, and the emails/handles of the core team members.
2. Call `notion_page_create` to generate a "Master Project Wiki" page. Structure the page body with standard headings: "Goals", "Milestones", "Resources", and "Action Items".
3. Call `slack_create_channel` to instantly provision a new channel named `#proj-[name]`.
4. Call `slack_invite_users` to add the provided team members to the new channel.
5. Send an automated welcome message to the new Slack channel containing the link to the generated Notion Wiki.
6. Confirm successful project initialization to the user.

::assertions
assert project_name != "" "A project name is required to initialize the workspace."
